# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The five paths below were unmodified AstroWind template demo pages that
# shipped to production with the theme. They were live, indexed in
# sitemap-0.xml, and contained placeholder content that misrepresented the
# NRP (a fictional "AstroWind LLC" as data controller, lorem ipsum, and a
# paid pricing tier for a platform that is free).
#
# They are deleted rather than rewritten. These 301s exist so inbound search
# traffic and any external links land on something real instead of a 404.
#
# NOTE: /privacy and /terms have no genuine replacement yet. Real versions
# need to be written and reviewed by the PI / institutional counsel; see
# DESIGN.md and static/NRP-AUP.pdf.
#
# /about no longer redirects: it is a real page again (src/pages/about.astro),
# carrying what the NRP is, the leadership, NSF funding, and the team. It
# replaced /people, which now redirects to it.

/services   /                                              301
/pricing    /documentation/userdocs/start/getting-started/  301
/privacy    /                                              301
/terms      /NRP-AUP.pdf                                   301

# /people was reworked into /about rather than kept alongside it.
/people     /about                                         301
